<main id="main">

<div class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Established under the NCISM Act, 2020</span>
      <h1 data-split>Standards for Ayurveda, Unani, Siddha and Sowa-Rigpa.</h1>
      <div class="motto" lang="sa">।। आयुषे सर्वलोकानाम् ।।</div>
      <p class="motto-en">For the life and health of all people</p>
      <p class="lede">The Commission regulates medical education and practice across India's four recognised traditional systems — setting curricula, assessing institutions, and maintaining the national register.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary magnetic" href="#finder">
          Check a college's status
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h13M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#notices">Public notices</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-art" data-par="0.08">
      <span class="halo" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="ring" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="pill glass pill-1" style="--pc:var(--leaf)"><i></i>Permission status, live</span>
      <span class="pill glass pill-2" style="--pc:var(--gold-2)"><i></i>4 recognised systems</span>
      <span class="pill glass pill-3" style="--pc:var(--teal-3)"><i></i>National register</span>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 300 300" role="img" aria-label="The NCISM emblem: four leaves rising from a central figure beneath a sun arc">
        <defs>
