<section id="tasks">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head rv">
      <span class="eyebrow">Start here</span>
      <h2>What do you need to do?</h2>
      <p>Four tasks account for most visits to this site. Everything else sits one level deeper.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="tasks">
      <a class="task glass tilt rv" href="#finder" style="--tc:var(--leaf);--tc-tint:var(--tint-leaf)">
        <span class="spot"></span>
        <span class="task-ico"><svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 21h18M5 21V8l7-5 7 5v13M9 21v-5h6v5"/></svg></span>
        <h4>Check a college</h4>
        <p>Is an institution permitted to admit students this academic year?</p>
        <span class="go">Open the finder <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h13M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span>
      </a>
      <a class="task glass tilt rv" href="#" style="--tc:var(--teal);--tc-tint:var(--tint-teal)">
        <span class="spot"></span>
        <span class="task-ico"><svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11v18H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><path d="M8 7h6M8 11h6"/></svg></span>
        <h4>Find a syllabus</h4>
        <p>Curriculum, academic calendar and record books for every professional year.</p>
        <span class="go">Browse academics <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h13M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span>
      </a>
      <a class="task glass tilt rv" href="#notices" style="--tc:var(--orange);--tc-tint:var(--tint-orange)">
        <span class="spot"></span>
        <span class="task-ico"><svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3a6 6 0 0 0-6 6c0 4-2 5-2 7h16c0-2-2-3-2-7a6 6 0 0 0-6-6z"/><path d="M10 20a2 2 0 0 0 4 0"/></svg></span>
        <h4>Read a notice</h4>
        <p>Public notices, tenders, recruitment and results — dated and searchable.</p>
        <span class="go">See all notices <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h13M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span>
      </a>
      <a class="task glass tilt rv" href="#" style="--tc:var(--gold);--tc-tint:var(--tint-gold)">
        <span class="spot"></span>
        <span class="task-ico"><svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 21c0-4 3.6-6 8-6s8 2 8 6"/></svg></span>
        <h4>Verify a practitioner</h4>
        <p>Search the national register of AUS&amp;SR medical professionals.</p>
        <span class="go">Open the register <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h13M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="notices">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="notice-wrap">
      <div class="glass panel-pad rv-l">
        <div class="sec-head" style="margin-bottom:1rem">
          <span class="eyebrow">Announcements</span>
          <h2>Notices &amp; circulars</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="tabs" role="tablist">
          <button class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-tab="notices">Public notices</button>
          <button class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-tab="tenders">Tenders</button>
          <button class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-tab="jobs">Recruitment</button>
          <button class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-tab="results">Results</button>
        </div>
        <ul class="notice-list" id="noticeList"></ul>
      </div>
      <aside class="rv-r">
        <div class="aside-card glass">
          <h4><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="17" rx="2"/><path d="M8 2v4M16 2v4M3 10h18"/></svg> Autonomous boards</h4>
          <ul class="board-list">
            <li><a href="#">Board of Ayurveda <span class="ab">BoA</span></a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Unani, Siddha &amp; Sowa-Rigpa <span class="ab">BUSS</span></a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Ethics &amp; Registration <span class="ab">BERISM</span></a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Assessment &amp; Rating <span class="ab">MARBISM</span></a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="aside-card glass mustread">
          <h4><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 9v4M12 17h.01"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/></svg> Must read</h4>
          <p>Advisory on colleges denied permission by NCISM but permitted by interim orders of the Hon'ble Courts.</p>
          <a href="#">Read the advisory <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h13M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="systems">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head rv">
      <span class="eyebrow">Four recognised systems</span>
      <h2>Indian Systems of Medicine</h2>
      <p>Each system carries its own curriculum, academic calendar and roll of permitted institutions.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="systems">
      <a class="sys glass tilt rv-s" href="#" style="--sg:linear-gradient(135deg,#B26412,#E08A10)">
        <span class="sys-top"><span class="sys-glyph" lang="sa">आ</span></span>
        <span class="sys-body">
          <h4>Ayurveda</h4>
          <p>"The science of life." A discipline of the upaveda in the Vedic tradition, and the largest of the four systems by intake.</p>
          <span class="sys-meta"><span><b>BAMS</b> UG</span><span><b>MD/MS</b> PG</span></span>
        </span>
      </a>
      <a class="sys glass tilt rv-s" href="#" style="--sg:linear-gradient(135deg,#C79412,#F0CE4A)">
        <span class="sys-top"><span class="sys-glyph" lang="hi">यू</span></span>
        <span class="sys-body">
          <h4>Unani</h4>
          <p>Unani-tibb, practised across West and South Asia, built on the humoral tradition and centuries of clinical refinement.</p>
          <span class="sys-meta"><span><b>BUMS</b> UG</span><span><b>MD</b> PG</span></span>
        </span>
      </a>
      <a class="sys glass tilt rv-s" href="#" style="--sg:linear-gradient(135deg,#17796B,#48AC92)">
        <span class="sys-top"><span class="sys-glyph" lang="hi">सि</span></span>
        <span class="sys-body">
          <h4>Siddha</h4>
          <p>Founded by the Siddhars of southern India, chiefly in Tamil Nadu — among the oldest continuously practised systems.</p>
          <span class="sys-meta"><span><b>BSMS</b> UG</span><span><b>MD</b> PG</span></span>
        </span>
      </a>
      <a class="sys glass tilt rv-s" href="#" style="--sg:linear-gradient(135deg,#3FA832,#91B62A)">
        <span class="sys-top"><span class="sys-glyph" lang="hi">सो</span></span>
        <span class="sys-body">
          <h4>Sowa-Rigpa</h4>
          <p>The Himalayan healing science, diagnosing through pulse and urinalysis — recognised most recently of the four.</p>
          <span class="sys-meta"><span><b>BSRMS</b> UG</span><span><b>PG</b> emerging</span></span>
        </span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="finder">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head rv">
      <span class="eyebrow">The tool people come for</span>
      <h2>College finder</h2>
      <p>Every permission decision in one searchable place — instead of thirty PDFs titled "List of Permitted Colleges as on 05.02.2026".</p>
    </div>
    <div class="finder glass rv-s">
      <div class="finder-bar">
        <input id="fq" type="search" placeholder="Search by college or city…" aria-label="Search colleges">
        <select id="fsys" aria-label="Filter by system"><option value="">All systems</option><option>Ayurveda</option><option>Unani</option><option>Siddha</option><option>Sowa-Rigpa</option></select>
        <select id="fstate" aria-label="Filter by state"><option value="">All states</option></select>
        <select id="fstatus" aria-label="Filter by status"><option value="">Any status</option><option>Permitted</option><option>Conditional</option><option>Denied</option></select>
        <span class="finder-count" id="fcount"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="tbl-scroll">
        <table class="colleges">
          <thead><tr><th>Institution</th><th>System</th><th>State</th><th>Seats</th><th>A.Y. 2025–26</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody id="ftbody"></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="demo-note">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 8v5M12 16h.01"/></svg>
        Sample records for demonstration — institution names and statuses are illustrative, not official NCISM data.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="glance">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head rv">
      <span class="eyebrow">Indicative figures</span>
